<h2 id="dtitle">Cross-channel donors</h2>
<p class="dim">Superchat dollars per person, split by channel on one shared scale, with gifted memberships as hatched segments at their estimated price. "Active" shows when they gave across the period, one tick per stream they donated on. Click a name for that person's page. Tick people to compare them with everyone else, or switch to hiding them; shift-click ticks a range. The selection is part of the link.</p>
<div class="tools">
  <span id="ctoggles"></span>
  <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Find a name" aria-label="Find a name">
  <details class="cols"><summary>Columns</summary><div class="colmenu" id="colmenu"></div></details>
  <button id="onlysel" type="button" class="toggle" aria-pressed="false" hidden>Selected only</button>
  <button id="clearcombo" type="button" hidden></button>
  <span id="count"></span>
</div>
<div class="scroll"><table id="donors"><thead></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
